        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The match started already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got to... mm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, why is my sword here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Miss Maria brought it over earlier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Servant"
    },
    {
        "text": "She said she already gave it some adjustments, too. She guarantees it should be like new.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Servant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
