    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Byah\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Servant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm... light and limber. I've missed this feeling.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "P-Please be careful! Oh, my, you've broken the balustrade again! We just had the stonesmith repair that in the Victorian style last year...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Servant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you may as well just have someone renovate the whole place. In fact, you're in charge of that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really, another one of your whims?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Servant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as someone can live in it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Servant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Ah, no, I just... feel like I miss something, suddenly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "This sword... Maria's grandfather gave it to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Maria calls you an aunt, doesn't she?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Servant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Family hierarchy is one unending wordy mess. I still remember how Margaret put it\u2014'This is your... your... you know what, she's your auntie.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm only about as old as them, aren't I? Really\u2014auntie?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're very young. So young, and managing such a family enterprise. We take great pride in you, Miss Zofia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Servant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I snapped up all this land in one breath. Oh, back then, was I thinking I'd prove myself as well? Prove myself worthy of the 'Nearl' name, maybe? Worthy of the Radiant Knight...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... now's no time to pine for the past.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The car is all ready for you. Or do you think running there yourself might be faster?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Servant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think that's obvious\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
