    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_sportsbar",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like a hunter toying with his prey, the Left-hand Knight keeps letting his foe gather herself and try again, and each time, he strikes Maria Nearl back down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 50,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Marcin! We're back! How's it going?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why's Maria up against someone at that goddamned level? Has the Association gone mad?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That'll be a long story... Are those kids safe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "For the moment, can say that much. But they already got legal knighthood stripped right off them. Pfeh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Never thought I'd see things get so goddarned out of hand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ashlock, Flametail, two other Infected knights without titles, and all the Infected they bought back from the arenas using everything they had...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fighters! And the people toying with those Infected for fun\u2014for god's sakes, they're all children! Their oldest was only twenty! Youngest was barely\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if they hid themselves in the pipelines, just one full day in city bounds and their safety'd be out the window. Not to mention the crowd we have now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I got some old friends to look after them, but the Infected are Infected, still. Wish things'd be simple as that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...We're not just picking a fight with the companies, now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Scared?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Scared?! Wasn't even scared when the Ursus were holding spears to my mouth! I'm a goddamned Ursus myself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fiddlesticks! When'd the Craftsmen ever get off those city walls?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?! Instead of running up there, you think we should've just sat in the smithy and let the catapult smash all of us flat too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Maria can't win this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aye. The Maria we know facing a foe like that, just ain't no way she'll win.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, not that there's no way. I mean she just can't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Knights Association have played their hand too hard now. Add in that rotten Czarny popping up, and there's no way it can go ahead that simple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
