        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Nnh...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "(My... my arm's about to dislocate... his spear\u2014I can't get close at all\u2014)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "(\u2014No, even if I did, there's still no way I'd win... what do I do...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_105"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Continue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Grit my teeth, and get up.) Nngh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_105"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the verge of toppling? You really are the image of your 'family knighthood,' struggling for breath.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Up. Continue. The best way to stamp out a knight is to stamp out her dignity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "He taunts! He taunts, over and over! A look of disdain and victory in one, aimed square at his opponent! 'Left-hand' Tytus will make your blood run cold!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now the prize pool's leaning completely one way, and the odds and figures are both out of control! Don't blink, but the money right now's gotta be on par with every other arena in Kazimierz combined!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Give it all you've got, Nearl! If you pull it outta the bag somehow, I'll win enough to buy a whole castle!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you nuts? How much money did you put on her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014I put down even more on Left-hand! But I'm making nothing the way this is going, so I'm just hedging my bets a little!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
