    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hgghh... hah... hah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_105"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "A visionary without a vision... wants to be a knight too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't kill you. Forfeit. The times of old will not fade for having done so. Abandon this, and you abandon only yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you... sympathizing with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_105"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Correct. As you do not deserve for me to treat you as a knight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
