        "name": "avg_npc_105"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've seen footage of your fights. From Szewczyk, through the race, the melee...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "I went out of my way to observe 'the Nearl family's new knight,' and every lucky victory of yours was a personal affront to me\u2014look at you. You had the gall to waste my time like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
