        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ughh\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_105"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stand firm, Maria Nearl. I will tell you the worlds that separate you and the Radiant Knight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her shining light could drown her opponent's will. Her sheer passion made me tremble. Her sheer talent made others envy her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you\u2014victory against you is trivial. I will extinguish your resolve, to a pile of ash.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
