    {
        "text": "Airtime! Tytus has once against sent Maria's weapon flying!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, man, this loop of devastation is too much bear, but no problem! The arena isn't just to let flesh and blood fly\u2014it lets knights go on a rampage of pure strength!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Taunting! Pressuring! Destroying! This is 'Left-hand' Tytus, mercilessly disposing of the weak!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
